{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1493","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. GCD of an Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$. You are asked to process $$$q$$$ queries of the following format: given integers $$$i$$$ and $$$x$$$, multiply $$$a_i$$$ by $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After processing each query you need to output the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatest_common_divisor"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"greatest common divisor (GCD)"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of all elements of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since the answer can be too large, you are asked to output it modulo $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers — $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the elements of the array $$$a$$$ before the changes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$q$$$ lines contain queries in the following format: each line contains two integers $$$i$$$ and $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$, $$$1 \\le x \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$q$$$ lines: after processing each query output the GCD of all elements modulo $$$10^9+7$$$ on a separate line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 3\n1 6 8 12\n1 12\n2 3\n3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the first query the array is $$$[12, 6, 8, 12]$$$, $$$\\operatorname{gcd}(12, 6, 8, 12) = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the second query — $$$[12, 18, 8, 12]$$$, $$$\\operatorname{gcd}(12, 18, 8, 12) = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the third query — $$$[12, 18, 24, 12]$$$, $$$\\operatorname{gcd}(12, 18, 24, 12) = 6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here the $$$\\operatorname{gcd}$$$ function denotes the greatest common divisor."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1493D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1493/problem/D"}